{title: Forever Reign}
{artist: Hillsong Worship}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]You are good You are good
When there’s nothing good in me
You are [C/B]love You are love
On display for all to see
You are [C]light You are light
When the darkness closes in
You are [C/B]hope You are hope
You have [C]covered all my sin

{comment: Verse 2}
[C]You are peace You are peace
When my fear is crippling
You are [C/B]true You are true
Even in my wandering
You are [C]joy You are joy
You're the reason that I sing
You are [C/B]life You are life
In You [C]death has lost it's sting

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Oh I’m running to Your [G/C]arms
I’m running to Your [Am]arms
The riches of Your love
Will [G]always be [F]enough
Nothing com[Am]pares to [G]Your em[F]brace
Light of the [Am]world for[G]ever [F]reign

{comment: Verse 3}
[C]You are more You are more
Than my words will ever say
[C/B]You are Lord You are Lord
All creation will proclaim
[C]You are here You are here
In Your presence I'm made whole
[C/B]You are God You are God
Of all else I’m letting go
(Repeat Chorus)

{comment: Bridge}
[Am7]My heart will sing
[F2]No other Name
[C]Jesus
[G]Jesus
